msgid "Hermes Agent Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:284
msgid "Running Tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:286
msgid "Use the `terminal` tool to run tests at each step:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:299
msgid "With delegate_task"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:301
msgid "When dispatching subagents for implementation, enforce TDD in the goal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:322
msgid "With systematic-debugging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:324
msgid ""
"Bug found? Write failing test reproducing it. Follow TDD cycle. The test "
"proves the fix and prevents regression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:326
msgid "Never fix bugs without a test."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:328
msgid "Testing Anti-Patterns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:330
msgid ""
"**Testing mock behavior instead of real behavior** — mocks should verify "
"interactions, not replace the system under test"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:331
msgid ""
"**Testing implementation details** — test behavior/results, not internal "
"method calls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:332
msgid "**Happy path only** — always test edge cases, errors, and boundaries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:333
msgid ""
"**Brittle tests** — tests should verify behavior, not structure; "
"refactoring shouldn't break them"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:335
msgid "Final Rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/test-driven-development_SKILL.md:342
msgid "No exceptions without the user's explicit permission."
msgstr ""

